The mayor nods and then says, “We must resolve the murder investigation quickly. My aide is not available, so I have requested the innkeeper’s assistance recording the accusation. If you need to visit the general store, this will be your last chance before the town gathers. I will take my leave now,” she says. “Whatever happens next, the people of Langston owe you a great debt.”

